{'symbol': 'ED', 'date': '2022-10-20 16:41:00', 'title': 'CON EDISON DECLARES COMMON STOCK DIVIDEND', 'text': "NEW YORK , OCT. 20, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CONSOLIDATED EDISON, INC. (CON EDISON) (NYSE: ED) DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF 79 CENTS A SHARE ON ITS COMMON STOCK, PAYABLE DECEMBER 15, 2022 TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF NOVEMBER 16, 2022. CONSOLIDATED EDISON, INC. IS ONE OF THE NATION'S LARGEST INVESTOR-OWNED ENERGY-DELIVERY COMPANIES, WITH APPROXIMATELY $14 BILLION IN ANNUAL REVENUES AND $64 BILLION IN ASSETS."}